	(descr "48-position DIP receptacle built from TWO Samtec SSM-124-L-SV 1x24 surface-mount socket strips. Official -SV recommended land geometry: 2.54mm pitch, staggered pad rows with 1.30mm inner clearance and 5.11mm overall span, implemented as 1.27 x 1.02mm pads at +-1.9275mm from each socket centreline. Socket centrelines are 15.24mm apart; pin span is 58.42mm. Numbering is standard DIP: 1-24 down x=0, 25-48 back up x=15.24. Top-side SMT; receives the XGecu adapter from above. This is a friction receptacle, not a ZIF mechanism.")
